(6827348, 1026329, 140305, '<td valign="top">I have been so busy lately - haven''t been able to spend much time entering challenges or commenting. Decided to take a quick look through these challenge entries as thumbnails because I really wanted to enter, but ran out of time. Anyways, on to the comment.....this image really grabbed my attention,  because of the light, the body language of the subject, the warm tones. Some may argue this is not a silhouette, but it fits my interpretation. I think this is a fantastic image. Great job.</td>', 'I have been so busy lately - haven''t been able to spend much time entering challenges or commenting. Decided to take a quick look through these challenge entries as thumbnails because I really wanted to enter, but ran out of time. Anyways, on to the comment.....this image really grabbed my attention,  because of the light, the body language of the subject, the warm tones. Some may argue this is not a silhouette, but it fits my interpretation. I think this is a fantastic image. Great job.', '2012-07-25 18:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
