(6827564, 1026907, 96751, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. So far, this is the only image I''m certain will be on the front page. Textbook silhouette, with the subject perfectly separated from his also dark surroundings. The weight of age. Just splendid</td>', 'Brilliant. So far, this is the only image I''m certain will be on the front page. Textbook silhouette, with the subject perfectly separated from his also dark surroundings. The weight of age. Just splendid', '2012-07-25 22:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
