(6829630, 1027001, 140537, '<td valign="top">Really terrific. Great timing on the capture - love the hair, great processing, the eye wander a bit and then locks in on the little girls.</td>', 'Really terrific. Great timing on the capture - love the hair, great processing, the eye wander a bit and then locks in on the little girls.', '2012-07-28 12:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829631, 1026758, 140537, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2012-07-28 12:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829632, 1026478, 140537, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good colors. Your kung fu is very good.</td>', 'Very nice. Good colors. Your kung fu is very good.', '2012-07-28 12:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829842, 1026952, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice...well done.</td>', 'Nice...well done.', '2012-07-28 23:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829843, 1026741, 57447, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect.</td>', 'Very cool effect.', '2012-07-28 23:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829845, 1026758, 57447, '<td valign="top">Clouds make this spectacular.</td>', 'Clouds make this spectacular.', '2012-07-28 23:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829971, 1026921, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the angle here.  Perhaps pushing the exposure darker would have made the silhouette pop more.  You may also try a tighter crop on the upper left 2/3rds.</td>', 'I like the angle here.  Perhaps pushing the exposure darker would have made the silhouette pop more.  You may also try a tighter crop on the upper left 2/3rds.', '2012-07-29 09:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829972, 1026984, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen, with really nice tonality.  The silhouette is not that strong of a component here.  I wonder if using the bench and tree with a differnet composition for another challenge might be something to try.</td>', 'Nicely seen, with really nice tonality.  The silhouette is not that strong of a component here.  I wonder if using the bench and tree with a differnet composition for another challenge might be something to try.', '2012-07-29 09:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829973, 1026342, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the outline of the bird here, although there is some blur/OOF on the edges.  Perhaps a more squarish crop would have given the bird more power.</td>', 'I like the outline of the bird here, although there is some blur/OOF on the edges.  Perhaps a more squarish crop would have given the bird more power.', '2012-07-29 09:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829975, 1026401, 91496, '<td valign="top">I love the idea here.  There are so many stories and visual aeas of interest.  The OOF wall nicely draws my eye to the figure.  Perhaps too many visual elements as lines, shadows, and lights are all fighting and drawing my eyes away from the figure.</td>', 'I love the idea here.  There are so many stories and visual aeas of interest.  The OOF wall nicely draws my eye to the figure.  Perhaps too many visual elements as lines, shadows, and lights are all fighting and drawing my eyes away from the figure.', '2012-07-29 10:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829976, 1026784, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting object with a nice angle.  The hand has a tiny bit of sidelight which disrupts the effect a bit.  Just a bit plain though and not a lot to explore beyond the intial viewing.</td>', 'Interesting object with a nice angle.  The hand has a tiny bit of sidelight which disrupts the effect a bit.  Just a bit plain though and not a lot to explore beyond the intial viewing.', '2012-07-29 10:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829978, 1026783, 91496, '<td valign="top">Lots off nice lines to lead you around the imaage.  I like the lower figures pose, the upper one is a little awkward.  Perhaps a paneld crop cutting off the top 20% and bottom 30% would have more immpact.</td>', 'Lots off nice lines to lead you around the imaage.  I like the lower figures pose, the upper one is a little awkward.  Perhaps a paneld crop cutting off the top 20% and bottom 30% would have more immpact.', '2012-07-29 10:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829979, 1026996, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of view and the framing of the flowers on each eadge by the bushes.  Something in the tonality does not wotk for me.  Is there a blueish cast here?  Perhaps crouching even lower and/or trying some compositions without the sun would be other things to try.</td>', 'I like the angle of view and the framing of the flowers on each eadge by the bushes.  Something in the tonality does not wotk for me.  Is there a blueish cast here?  Perhaps crouching even lower and/or trying some compositions without the sun would be other things to try.', '2012-07-29 10:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829980, 1026801, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great cloud and sun rays in the sky.  Having the baloon all silhoeutted would have been more powerful.  I am not sure the trees add or substract from the composition.</td>', 'Great cloud and sun rays in the sky.  Having the baloon all silhoeutted would have been more powerful.  I am not sure the trees add or substract from the composition.', '2012-07-29 10:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829983, 1026990, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen and shot.  I like the moment that you have captured here.  A paneled crop removing the upper 40% and lower 20% may have more impact.  The border subracts from the image rather than adds to it.</td>', 'Nicely seen and shot.  I like the moment that you have captured here.  A paneled crop removing the upper 40% and lower 20% may have more impact.  The border subracts from the image rather than adds to it.', '2012-07-29 10:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829989, 1026843, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen and shot.  I like the moment that you have captured here.  The square crop does not work for me here.  I see two photos here: 1) A landscape view removing the upper 20% and 2) A landscape view removing the lower 20%.</td>', 'Nicely seen and shot.  I like the moment that you have captured here.  The square crop does not work for me here.  I see two photos here: 1) A landscape view removing the upper 20% and 2) A landscape view removing the lower 20%.', '2012-07-29 10:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6829991, 1026673, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here.  The water makes a great backdrop for the silhoeutted fishermman.  I just wish the 3 were closer together so there was not so much dead space in the frame.</td>', 'I like the idea here.  The water makes a great backdrop for the silhoeutted fishermman.  I just wish the 3 were closer together so there was not so much dead space in the frame.', '2012-07-29 10:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830031, 1026970, 143622, '<td valign="top">Very creative, perfect light and just the right parasol to set off the image. Beautiful silhouette created and composition, angle, and negative space couldn''t be better. Incredible photograph.</td>', 'Very creative, perfect light and just the right parasol to set off the image. Beautiful silhouette created and composition, angle, and negative space couldn''t be better. Incredible photograph.', '2012-07-29 11:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830037, 1027022, 143622, '<td valign="top">Great photo! I wonder how often cars come by. Really wonderful vision and idea, lighting seems right on, and composition pulls it off.</td>', 'Great photo! I wonder how often cars come by. Really wonderful vision and idea, lighting seems right on, and composition pulls it off.', '2012-07-29 11:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830040, 1026749, 147314, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the colours very much, although cropping could have been more tight. Technically I can see small white lines surrounding the silhouette, probably chromatic abberation, which should be removed. <br/>Altogether a very nice first submission I have to say.</td>', 'I like the concept and the colours very much, although cropping could have been more tight. Technically I can see small white lines surrounding the silhouette, probably chromatic abberation, which should be removed. Altogether a very nice first submission I have to say.', '2012-07-29 12:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830041, 1026813, 147314, '<td valign="top">Like this picture very much, especially the colours in the sky and in the lake. Considering the title, I should have cropped the picture quite a bit more, in order to draw attention the the moon.</td>', 'Like this picture very much, especially the colours in the sky and in the lake. Considering the title, I should have cropped the picture quite a bit more, in order to draw attention the the moon.', '2012-07-29 12:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830043, 1026971, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great action shot with a great silhouette of the drummer. Find the top half (a lot of white lights/sky) a bit distracting.</td>', 'Great action shot with a great silhouette of the drummer. Find the top half (a lot of white lights/sky) a bit distracting.', '2012-07-29 12:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
