(6830765, 1026892, 142345, '<td valign="top">The sand looks a little over-processed for my tastes, but I like the position and poses of the people.</td>', 'The sand looks a little over-processed for my tastes, but I like the position and poses of the people.', '2012-07-30 15:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830766, 1026900, 142345, '<td valign="top">Really like the background color and great silhouettes.</td>', 'Really like the background color and great silhouettes.', '2012-07-30 15:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830768, 1026767, 142345, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped a bit more off the top/right side, but good capture.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped a bit more off the top/right side, but good capture.', '2012-07-30 15:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830771, 1027029, 142345, '<td valign="top">I get a sense of ''Free sprit'' or ''Happiness/Joy'' from that shot.</td>', 'I get a sense of ''Free sprit'' or ''Happiness/Joy'' from that shot.', '2012-07-30 15:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830791, 1026170, 104009, '<td valign="top">the clouds on the bottom don''t add to the image, for me at least</td>', 'the clouds on the bottom don''t add to the image, for me at least', '2012-07-30 15:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830854, 1027001, 149507, '<td valign="top">The wind-blown hair on the middle child really makes this image and gives a lot of atmosphere. The fuzzy quality is often overdone but it works well here and makes this feel like an earlier memory. I also like that you didn''t yield to the temptation to include the entire tree and instead used it for framing.</td>', 'The wind-blown hair on the middle child really makes this image and gives a lot of atmosphere. The fuzzy quality is often overdone but it works well here and makes this feel like an earlier memory. I also like that you didn''t yield to the temptation to include the entire tree and instead used it for framing.', '2012-07-30 17:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830859, 1026952, 149507, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful, and the golden border around the strong silhouette at the focal point works well.</td>', 'The colors are beautiful, and the golden border around the strong silhouette at the focal point works well.', '2012-07-30 17:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830865, 1027022, 149507, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept with nice lighting and beautiful lines. The model is well placed so the curved lines of the tunnel to lead the eye into the distance. Her shadow makes great shapes on the pavement. The only thing I don''t like is that the pose makes her feet look a little odd, but that''s a minor nit-pick.</td>', 'This is a great concept with nice lighting and beautiful lines. The model is well placed so the curved lines of the tunnel to lead the eye into the distance. Her shadow makes great shapes on the pavement. The only thing I don''t like is that the pose makes her feet look a little odd, but that''s a minor nit-pick.', '2012-07-30 17:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830872, 1026608, 149507, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic location with lots of beautiful lines and the high contrast makes very good use of it. Some of your highlights are a little blown out (e.g. the boat''s crossbeams and at the very top of the image) and spoils the sharp lines a little bit. I also think you could have kept a little less of the image on the bottom.</td>', 'This is a fantastic location with lots of beautiful lines and the high contrast makes very good use of it. Some of your highlights are a little blown out (e.g. the boat''s crossbeams and at the very top of the image) and spoils the sharp lines a little bit. I also think you could have kept a little less of the image on the bottom.', '2012-07-30 17:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830881, 1026970, 149507, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent concept and I like that both the model and the umbrella give clean silhouettes. I like the use of both the umbrella and the vignette to frame the model''s head. As a minor criticism, having the model''s left hand (holding the large umbrella) held close to her body spoils the shape of her silhouette a little bit.</td>', 'This is an excellent concept and I like that both the model and the umbrella give clean silhouettes. I like the use of both the umbrella and the vignette to frame the model''s head. As a minor criticism, having the model''s left hand (holding the large umbrella) held close to her body spoils the shape of her silhouette a little bit.', '2012-07-30 17:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830887, 1026987, 149507, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a large enough depth of field to give a clean outline to the silhouette.</td>', 'Nice use of a large enough depth of field to give a clean outline to the silhouette.', '2012-07-30 17:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830894, 1027031, 149507, '<td valign="top">A simple concept but well thought out and executed. Create use of background lighting rather than shooting directly into the light source to create the silhouette. The angle and cropping lend tension to the scene and work very well with the concept.</td>', 'A simple concept but well thought out and executed. Create use of background lighting rather than shooting directly into the light source to create the silhouette. The angle and cropping lend tension to the scene and work very well with the concept.', '2012-07-30 17:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830902, 1026167, 149507, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the lines in the pavement is excellent. The image would be improved if the pedestrian didn''t look like he had one leg and didn''t overlap with the bollard, but you can''t always pick your poses.</td>', 'The lighting on the lines in the pavement is excellent. The image would be improved if the pedestrian didn''t look like he had one leg and didn''t overlap with the bollard, but you can''t always pick your poses.', '2012-07-30 17:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830903, 1026900, 149507, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the crisp silhouettes and coloring. The diagonal arrangement of the three birds fills out the frame well. Due to the motion of the birds, their shapes are a little confusing. The halos around the birds and the branches are a little distracting.</td>', 'I like the concept and the crisp silhouettes and coloring. The diagonal arrangement of the three birds fills out the frame well. Due to the motion of the birds, their shapes are a little confusing. The halos around the birds and the branches are a little distracting.', '2012-07-30 17:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830906, 1026511, 149507, '<td valign="top">The water droplets lend a lot of action to the scene. The splayed feathers make a really nice, clean silhouette.</td>', 'The water droplets lend a lot of action to the scene. The splayed feathers make a really nice, clean silhouette.', '2012-07-30 17:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830908, 1026961, 149507, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shape and lovely colors. The ripples in the bird''s shadow are especially beautiful and if you had been able to have more of it in the frame it would be even better. Personally I''d prefer a little less extra space and a less square image.</td>', 'A beautiful shape and lovely colors. The ripples in the bird''s shadow are especially beautiful and if you had been able to have more of it in the frame it would be even better. Personally I''d prefer a little less extra space and a less square image.', '2012-07-30 18:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830910, 1026625, 149507, '<td valign="top">Great job of selecting a pose that makes beautiful lines as well as catching the lights just right to produce thin outlines. It''s a shame but I''m sure a lot of people will say it''s not a "true" silhouette and mark it down.</td>', 'Great job of selecting a pose that makes beautiful lines as well as catching the lights just right to produce thin outlines. It''s a shame but I''m sure a lot of people will say it''s not a "true" silhouette and mark it down.', '2012-07-30 18:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830915, 1026970, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this. The different lines and geometric shapes are wonderful.</td>', 'I really enjoy this. The different lines and geometric shapes are wonderful.', '2012-07-30 18:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830917, 1027034, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. Too bad the spoon isn''t darkened more.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. Too bad the spoon isn''t darkened more.', '2012-07-30 18:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830920, 1027038, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice. The background color really adds a mood.</td>', 'Nice. The background color really adds a mood.', '2012-07-30 18:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830921, 1026768, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of the sun.</td>', 'Great use of the sun.', '2012-07-30 18:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830922, 1026694, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of colors and lines.</td>', 'Very nice use of colors and lines.', '2012-07-30 18:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830926, 1027022, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a fun an unexpected photo.</td>', 'What a fun an unexpected photo.', '2012-07-30 18:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830943, 1026971, 109387, '<td valign="top">Very nice one!</td>', 'Very nice one!', '2012-07-30 18:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
