(6830990, 1026944, 60495, '<td valign="top">I love the sky and the silhouettes but hate the tilted horizon, really think this would have been much better with a little leveling, still overall a very nice shot.</td>', 'I love the sky and the silhouettes but hate the tilted horizon, really think this would have been much better with a little leveling, still overall a very nice shot.', '2012-07-30 19:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
