(6832288, 1027022, 129807, '<td valign="top">There definitely needs to be more honking in the world :) Excellent image, well done! I do like the colouring and the shapes the lights make on the walls.</td>', 'There definitely needs to be more honking in the world :) Excellent image, well done! I do like the colouring and the shapes the lights make on the walls.', '2012-08-01 10:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832289, 1026813, 129807, '<td valign="top">The colours in this are amazing - just the right blues in the sky and water. Your image makes me want to be there with fishing rod in hand too!</td>', 'The colours in this are amazing - just the right blues in the sky and water. Your image makes me want to be there with fishing rod in hand too!', '2012-08-01 10:21:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832291, 1026944, 129807, '<td valign="top">You found some very interesting and beautiful silhouettes and treated the scene beautifully. As has been mentioned, I think the tilted horizon really compromises this image.</td>', 'You found some very interesting and beautiful silhouettes and treated the scene beautifully. As has been mentioned, I think the tilted horizon really compromises this image.', '2012-08-01 10:25:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832293, 1027039, 129807, '<td valign="top">What would you have titled it? This is a well composed image with excellent subject detail and treatment of the light.</td>', 'What would you have titled it? This is a well composed image with excellent subject detail and treatment of the light.', '2012-08-01 10:28:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832297, 1026961, 129807, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. I really liked this during voting. I would have loved to see more bird reflection and less (if any) bank, but fully understand that sometimes these things just aren''t possible. Congrats on TT :)</td>', 'Excellent capture. I really liked this during voting. I would have loved to see more bird reflection and less (if any) bank, but fully understand that sometimes these things just aren''t possible. Congrats on TT :)', '2012-08-01 10:31:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832303, 1026948, 108580, '<td valign="top">Fabulous work and oh so unusual to silhouette it.</td>', 'Fabulous work and oh so unusual to silhouette it.', '2012-08-01 10:33:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832309, 1026768, 129807, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favourites in this challenge. I really wish the top and the right side were cropped off and my personal preference is for more vibrant colours, but I just adore the detail in that silhouette. And I''m no musician but it looks like he''s actually playing and not just pretending to, which lends a whole level of believability (is that a word?) into this. Congrats on a well deserved TT!</td>', 'This was one of my favourites in this challenge. I really wish the top and the right side were cropped off and my personal preference is for more vibrant colours, but I just adore the detail in that silhouette. And I''m no musician but it looks like he''s actually playing and not just pretending to, which lends a whole level of believability (is that a word?) into this. Congrats on a well deserved TT!', '2012-08-01 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832317, 1026758, 129807, '<td valign="top">I''ve always been a fan of the way you treat light and this is no exception. It almost looks like the lighthouse is perched in the sky, shining it''s light over the clouds. I love the blues in the outtake too.</td>', 'I''ve always been a fan of the way you treat light and this is no exception. It almost looks like the lighthouse is perched in the sky, shining it''s light over the clouds. I love the blues in the outtake too.', '2012-08-01 10:41:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832324, 1026971, 129807, '<td valign="top">Excellent and individual take on the challenge. Well executed shot given the difficult light conditions - lending itself to a perfect silhouette with just the right amount of detail. Great capture, congrats on TT.</td>', 'Excellent and individual take on the challenge. Well executed shot given the difficult light conditions - lending itself to a perfect silhouette with just the right amount of detail. Great capture, congrats on TT.', '2012-08-01 10:45:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832325, 1026971, 100831, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Really nice framing - great shot!</td>', 'Congrats! Really nice framing - great shot!', '2012-08-01 10:47:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832329, 1027029, 129807, '<td valign="top">Great sky, terrific silhouette, nice composition too. My nitpick (only a small one) - I wished for more room above her hand.</td>', 'Great sky, terrific silhouette, nice composition too. My nitpick (only a small one) - I wished for more room above her hand.', '2012-08-01 10:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832342, 1026478, 129807, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites during voting. Not only do you have excellent detail and a background of which I''m SO jealous, you have a sense of humour too (title-wise). I found myself bending to the right in an attempt to orient the image in my mind, then wondering if the new position of my head was, indeed, ''mantis-style''!</td>', 'One of my favourites during voting. Not only do you have excellent detail and a background of which I''m SO jealous, you have a sense of humour too (title-wise). I found myself bending to the right in an attempt to orient the image in my mind, then wondering if the new position of my head was, indeed, ''mantis-style''!', '2012-08-01 10:56:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832343, 1026648, 66267, '<td valign="top">good books</td>', 'good books', '2012-08-01 10:56:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832345, 1026970, 43463, '<td valign="top">I am an absolute sucker for umbrella shots (I have 11 different umbrellas that I have collected for photo shoots). This one is stellar! Beautiful, rich, and warm red &amp; orange tones complement the scene. The umbrella is like the setting sun. I love how the shape of the fan mimics/complements the spoke wheel shape of the umbrella (a half circle to the full circle). The silhouette of the lady is perfectly accomplished. She is elegance itself. Congrats on capturing such a stunning image!</td>', 'I am an absolute sucker for umbrella shots (I have 11 different umbrellas that I have collected for photo shoots). This one is stellar! Beautiful, rich, and warm red & orange tones complement the scene. The umbrella is like the setting sun. I love how the shape of the fan mimics/complements the spoke wheel shape of the umbrella (a half circle to the full circle). The silhouette of the lady is perfectly accomplished. She is elegance itself. Congrats on capturing such a stunning image!', '2012-08-01 10:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6832390, 1026855, 129807, '<td valign="top">I really like the texture you''ve captured in the wall. It took me a second to work out the inversion - great concept followed with top class execution.</td>', 'I really like the texture you''ve captured in the wall. It took me a second to work out the inversion - great concept followed with top class execution.', '2012-08-01 11:22:05.000000', NULL, 0),
