(6832803, 1027022, 103032, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the red. Great story to boot. <br/> <br/><i>"This is the type of thing that keeps me at DPC -- the unexpected, fun times that happen when I go out to shoot something that I probably wouldn''t have shot if it weren''t for a challenge. My family and I have had some fun and unique adventures because of DPC."</i> - <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=103142" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">vawendy</a> <br/> <br/>I concur with your thoughts above :)</td>', 'Congrats on the red. Great story to boot.  "This is the type of thing that keeps me at DPC -- the unexpected, fun times that happen when I go out to shoot something that I probably wouldn''t have shot if it weren''t for a challenge. My family and I have had some fun and unique adventures because of DPC." -  vawendy  I concur with your thoughts above :)', '2012-08-01 17:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
