(6833191, 1026681, 16148, '<td valign="top">Deb, I gave you a 6.  I like your idea for a silhouette and the sturdy railing is a nice backdrop.  I wish there was more detail in the asphalt.  My preference on composition would be to crop about 25% off the top and maybe some off the right.  If you made these changes it would be nice to see more pavement below so the horizon isn''t dead center.  I''m a sucker for textures and this has great potential.  If I look at this later I might have a different idea ;-)  It''s really what you like that matters.</td>', 'Deb, I gave you a 6.  I like your idea for a silhouette and the sturdy railing is a nice backdrop.  I wish there was more detail in the asphalt.  My preference on composition would be to crop about 25% off the top and maybe some off the right.  If you made these changes it would be nice to see more pavement below so the horizon isn''t dead center.  I''m a sucker for textures and this has great potential.  If I look at this later I might have a different idea ;-)  It''s really what you like that matters.', '2012-08-02 00:59:48.000000', NULL, 0),
