(6833285, 1026971, 137576, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the TT! What were you doing back there??? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was working as guitar tech/ stage manager and photographer perks of it being my stage haha :)</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Congrats on the TT! What were you doing back there???   I was working as guitar tech/ stage manager and photographer perks of it being my stage haha :)', '2012-08-02 06:22:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6833409, 1027001, 61971, '<td valign="top">This is so awesome. Very emotive for me. Some of my favorite times of the day are when I am just sitting back watching my girls be little girls and playing.</td>', 'This is so awesome. Very emotive for me. Some of my favorite times of the day are when I am just sitting back watching my girls be little girls and playing.', '2012-08-02 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6833414, 1026605, 142473, '<td valign="top">I''m glad Don posted this one.  I would have otherwise missed it.  Incredible capture of light and emotion.<br/> <br/>To me, it looks like he''s looking at the water directly in front of him... warping our sense of spacial order in the image.  Looks like he wants to reach out and touch the water.</td>', 'I''m glad Don posted this one.  I would have otherwise missed it.  Incredible capture of light and emotion. To me, it looks like he''s looking at the water directly in front of him... warping our sense of spacial order in the image.  Looks like he wants to reach out and touch the water.', '2012-08-02 10:50:09.000000', NULL, 0),
