(6834513, 1027039, 123692, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pamb:</b></div><hr/><i> What would you have titled it? This is a well composed image with excellent subject detail and treatment of the light. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I actually was planning on titling this photo but it was kind of a last minute submission and from the time I uploaded the picture to the time it took to write the title it was too late and didn''t let me. So yeah last minute submission literally! I was going to title it "Hard Days Work" though.</td>', 'Originally posted by pamb: What would you have titled it? This is a well composed image with excellent subject detail and treatment of the light.  I actually was planning on titling this photo but it was kind of a last minute submission and from the time I uploaded the picture to the time it took to write the title it was too late and didn''t let me. So yeah last minute submission literally! I was going to title it "Hard Days Work" though.', '2012-08-03 15:11:19.000000', NULL, 0),
